      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AGED CARE (5) didn't measure up in the Townsville Cup last time out but the form prior was full of merit. Gets in well at the weights with the 2kg claim and should find this assingment much more to his liking. Rates the testing material. NORTHERN PRIDE (1) is a six-time winner around this circuit who maps ideally for this from gate two. Looms as the main danger. OUTBACK ACTION (3) returned to the winners' stall over this track and trip at the latest effort and will have derived some confidence from that victory. Can go back-to-back without surprising. HELLISH (2) has two wins and a placing from four attempts over this course and distance and can make his presence felt. REAL KEY (4) will be rock-hard fit for this and may earn some minor money.",
